{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cow","model_identifier":"cow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# cow\n\nCow (B4), 1.35 m at the withers (48 u).\n\nLean dairy-type build with an udder, short horns, slim neck with dewlap. Same quadruped rig as the ox (jaw for chewing and mooing, two-bone tail with switch).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..45.0, z -47.0..25.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 15 x 48 x 48 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2.3, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, tail flicks |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop | gallop (flee) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing, odd front step (loop) |\n| `moo` | 2 | once | head lifts, mouth opens 0.8-1.4 s (the sound), back by 2.0 s |\n| `lie_down` | 2.4 | hold | front knees first, then hind; lies with legs folded and holds (play reversed to get up) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 43 u per cycle\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.5 m/s), cycle 0.55 s, 88 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `cow_black_white.png`: black and white patches\n- `cow_dun.png`: dun (pale tan, dark legs)\n- `cow_calf.png`: young texture (use at half scale): soft light red-brown, horns and udder painted as hide so they vanish visually\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is red-brown. Patch textures share one UV layout.\n"},"description":"# cow\n\nCow (B4), 1.35 m at the withers (48 u).\n\nLean dairy-type build with an udder, short horns, slim neck with dewlap. Same quadruped rig as the ox (jaw for chewing and mooing, two-bone tail with switch).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..45.0, z -47.0..25.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 15 x 48 x 48 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2.3, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, tail flicks |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop | gallop (flee) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing, odd front step (loop) |\n| `moo` | 2 | once | head lifts, mouth opens 0.8-1.4 s (the sound), back by 2.0 s |\n| `lie_down` | 2.4 | hold | front knees first, then hind; lies with legs folded and holds (play reversed to get up) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 43 u per cycle\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.5 m/s), cycle 0.55 s, 88 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `cow_black_white.png`: black and white patches\n- `cow_dun.png`: dun (pale tan, dark legs)\n- `cow_calf.png`: young texture (use at half scale): soft light red-brown, horns and udder painted as hide so they vanish visually\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is red-brown. Patch textures share one UV layout.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.5,22.5,-20.0],"to":[7.5,42.5,15.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,36,51.0,56.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[64,0,99.